  stop
else (yes)
endif
:**EMERGING TECHNOLOGY**  Extract parties, dates, case number, court and amount, each with confidence, source span and page;
:Compare the extracted parties and matter with the case record;
if (Document matches the case?) then (no)
  :status = REJECTED with a stated reason; conflicting fields highlighted; entry in the administrator rejection report;
  stop
